v 3
d optgr. Optimal Group Targeting for Poverty Reduction
d
d Author: Araar Abdelkrim
d Universite Laval & Partnership for Economic Policy (PEP)
d Support: aabd@ecn.ulaval.ca
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260512
d
d Description:
d This package implements the sequential data-graph algorithm of Araar 
d and Tiberti (2017) for optimal anti-poverty group targeting under a 
d fixed per-capita budget. It includes a vectorised implementation for 
d speedup and resolves the double-inflection problem for alpha=0.
d
